# Research (docs/story-npcs.md 4), part 2: with flag 0xC set as Cherenkov sets it (seen in npc_gate_searis),
# pin-warp from Jian's room to Jack's house (map 159) and list its objects to find Jack.
include boot_from_save
poke u32 0x02204620 0x1002
pin u16 0x020B77EC 0x9F
press Right 32
press Down,Right 32
press Right 32
press Down 70
wait 200
unpin
wait 120
peek u16 0x020B6BE4 map
shot gate_jack_room
dump 0x020B6FD4 0x200 objects_159
peek u32 0x020B6CB4 px
peek u32 0x020B6CB8 py
save jack_room
